  "milestone_caveat": "The exact G102 milestone is fully proved for every natural exponent and every modulus greater than one, including actual canonical digits, a beta-coded accumulator execution, modular-power correctness, and the formal bound k≤3·BitLen(e)+2. The independent T13 determinant/rank/integer-span substrate is now closed in the separate Alpha-v27 integer-linear-algebra branch.",
